["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Edward Said and the question of Palestine Orientalism Oslo Accord West-Eastern Divan Orchestra\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-throughline-萨义德把巴勒斯坦问题带进美国主流话语-却从未等到他期望的和解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4024x4024+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F02%2F04%2F30b53e8145b4a73e61d296056ad9%2F1c50c67c-46c2-421d-91f3-a194d2396347.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>萨义德把巴勒斯坦问题带进美国主流话语，却从未等到他期望的和解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">萨义德一生试图用文学与音乐的语言让西方理解巴勒斯坦人的存在，但他晚年亲眼看到奥斯陆协议签署后杀戮反而更多，并断定两国方案已被现实架空。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">巴以冲突</span><span class=\"tag\">后殖民理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Juba II: Rome’s King of Africa client king Euphorbia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-ancients-凯撒把战败敌人的幼子养大-养成了北非最亲罗马的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/118420a97bcb462e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>凯撒把战败敌人的幼子养大，养成了北非最亲罗马的国王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱巴二世两岁时作为战俘被凯撒牵着游街，却被收养进屋大维娅家中长大，最终被奥古斯都扶上毛里塔尼亚王位，统治四十年从未被罗马怀疑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马帝国</span><span class=\"tag\">北非历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Hatshepsut: Was This Really Egypt&#x27;s Greatest Pharaoh? regent Opet Festival co-regency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-historyhit-哈特谢普苏特不是女扮男装-她把自己做成了法老/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6426b5c63fd6a864-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>哈特谢普苏特不是女扮男装，她把自己做成了法老</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她不是伪装成男人的女王，而是把王权本身的图像语言——那副假胡须——改写成「国王」的标志，用贸易和建筑而非战争定义了何为伟大的统治者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">法老</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"724. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Into The Valley of Death (Part 4) redoubt the thin red line Causeway Heights\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-restishistory-轻骑兵冲锋并非愚蠢送死-战术上它其实成功了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77709224d0619622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>轻骑兵冲锋并非愚蠢送死：战术上它其实成功了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">命令含糊、将领失和导致六百轻骑兵冲向三面炮火的死亡谷，但他们真的打垮了俄军炮兵和骑兵，是战略上的灾难，战术上的胜利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亚战争</span><span class=\"tag\">军事史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"415. Lawrence of Arabia: Rory Stewart vs. William Dalrymple - The Legacy (Part 5) Seven Pillars of Wisdom Sykes-Picot McMahon letters India Office Arab Bulletin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-empirehist-劳伦斯写信痛斥英国在伊拉克撒谎-结果被昔日同僚联手抹黑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>劳伦斯写信痛斥英国在伊拉克撒谎，结果被昔日同僚联手抹黑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他对伊拉克占领的愤怒预言了百年后的战争现实，但正是这些批评招来印度事务处和外交部的全力抹黑，说他不懂阿拉伯语、没资格说话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"189: Geodesic顾全全：预训练有点“无聊”了，但用scaling改变AI制药才刚开始 训飞 Try2 Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-latetalk-预训练的新意正在变少-但把scaling搬进ai制药才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac7d832522d328e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>预训练的新意正在变少，但把Scaling搬进AI制药才刚开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字节的蛋白质结构设计模型只用2650万个结构数据就训出900兆参数模型，而公开结构数据有13亿个——算力而不是数据，才是AI制药现在最大的瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI制药</span><span class=\"tag\">Scaling</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Side Project to $9M Raised, No Co-Founder | Yahia Bakour, Context.dev NRR (Net Revenue Retention) design partner agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-solofounders-融到900万美元后他说-拿了风投的钱-更应该一个人创业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba8972d929c3a758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">57:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>融到900万美元后他说：拿了风投的钱，更应该一个人创业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把融资比作婚姻：一旦签了就是十年，而正因为用的是别人的钱，独自决策反而让该转向、该拒绝的艰难时刻更容易拍板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">独立创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What Does It All Mean, Though? trial by combat weregild\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-britishhist-罗兰之歌-审判戏其实是给封建公爵们的一记警告/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>《罗兰之歌》审判戏其实是给封建公爵们的一记警告</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加纳隆被马拉肢解、全家三十名男丁被灭门，这个结局是在为「国王拥有绝对暴力垄断权」的集权叙事背书，而非单纯的复仇故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪史</span><span class=\"tag\">封建制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Shopping in an Era of Surveillance Capitalism surveillance pricing drip pricing dark patterns loyalty penalty right to repair\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-mastersinbiz-忠诚计划的陷阱-你越常买-优惠反而越少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cce6bb022eede7c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>忠诚计划的陷阱：你越常买，优惠反而越少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一旦算法确认你是「稳定客户」，公司不再需要给你折扣，星巴克和麦当劳的用户数据报告都证明了这一点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">监控定价</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者权益</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Notion’s Founder on the One Thing Your AI Is Missing vibe coding headless product\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-aiandi-notion创始人-ai能给你代码-但不该替你保管-理解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9bccab920fb419de-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">33:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>Notion创始人：AI能给你代码，但不该替你保管「理解」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vibe coding让人人都能做软件，但Ivan Zhao认为真正耐久的不是UI和过程代码，而是数据和上下文——谁掌握这个，谁才是AI时代的赢家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Notion</span><span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Software factories and code reviews with Harjot Gill hill climbing software factory polyphasic sleep\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-pragmatic-创始人边开特斯拉fsd边指挥ai编码-月提交5000次/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1ee23f2f57f8e42d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>创始人边开特斯拉FSD边指挥AI编码，月提交5000次</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">CodeRabbit创始人认为人工代码评审已死，软件工程的瓶颈从人才转向token消耗，小团队靠驱动AI代理也能做到Facebook级别的发布规模，但代价是巨额算力和CPU账单。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI编程</span><span class=\"tag\">软件工厂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Do Pigeons Navigate with Their Livers? A New Study Sparks Debate magnetoreception radical pair hypothesis cryptochrome macrophage superparamagnetism authorization vs appropriations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-fromfirstprinc-鸽子用肝脏感知地球磁场-物理学家联手算出根本不可能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dabc3192df79062a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>鸽子用肝脏感知地球磁场？物理学家联手算出根本不可能</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这篇登上Science封面的论文称鸽子靠肝脏巨噬细胞在阴天导航，三位磁感应领域的元老级学者联手计算后反驳：该机制在体温下热噪声比磁场信号大30倍，物理上站不住脚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">磁感应</span><span class=\"tag\">鸽子导航</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"First observation of a giant star swallowing its neighbour common envelope phase/evolution dynamical friction quantum entanglement Bell test no-cloning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-naturepod-恒星直接吞噬伴星首次被观测到-结局是合并爆炸而非幸存双星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">24:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>恒星直接吞噬伴星首次被观测到，结局是合并爆炸而非幸存双星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天文学家在仙女座星系捕捉到一颗巨星七年缓慢变亮后突然爆发到百万倍太阳亮度，证据显示伴星没能逃脱，而是被拖入核心合并，而非常见理论里设想的「甩掉外壳、双星幸存」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">天体物理</span><span class=\"tag\">双星演化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Build The Future: Eric Glyman, Co-CEO of Ramp Jevons paradox Coase&#x27;s theorem AI harness MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-ycsp-ramp-内部不招人一个季度-只为逼团队学会用-ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c6301d17041505af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>Ramp 内部不招人一个季度，只为逼团队学会用 AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ramp 发现工程师用 AI 后生产力达到 100 倍，但销售、设计跟不上就会拖垮组织，于是干脆暂停整季招聘，强迫所有人把 AI 变成核心能力而非附加技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Louise Michel, Anarchist Paris Commune Kanak\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-stuffmissed-审判席上她不求宽恕-只要求与同志们一起受罚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>审判席上她不求宽恕，只要求与同志们一起受罚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法国政府以为流放和监禁能驯服她，结果路易丝·米歇尔在法庭上拒绝自辩，公开承认参与巴黎公社的一切行动并要求判处死刑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人物传记</span><span class=\"tag\">法国历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Missing Layer for Personal AI | First Person Labs’ Ken Liu confidential inference zero data retention Second Local reflective productivity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-a16z-ai给你建一个-第二人格-连创始人都看不到你的那份/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">33:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>AI给你建一个「第二人格」，连创始人都看不到你的那份</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">First Person Labs把数据和推理拆开：本地或机密计算里跑模型，公司自己也证明不了能看到你的内容，信任靠硬件而不是承诺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人AI</span><span class=\"tag\">机密计算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How GTA VI Became the Most Expensive Video Game Ever Made performance capture microtransactions stranger encounters\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-oddlots-gta6烧掉十几亿美元-但制作人说这是个例-不是行业范本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>GTA6烧掉十几亿美元，但制作人说这是个例，不是行业范本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rockstar靠GTA系列的确定性才敢把预算花到十几亿美元，而行业其他公司正因为销量没跟上预算增长而被迫削减开支，GTA6无法被复制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">游戏行业</span><span class=\"tag\">GTA6</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.292｜施展×刘擎：从阴山互市到上海口岸，碰撞中的秩序生成 impersonal plus game\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-cn27f438-明朝打不过蒙古就开放互市-战争立刻消失了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">35:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>明朝打不过蒙古就开放互市，战争立刻消失了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">嘉靖朝南倭北虏打得筋疲力尽，换了皇帝开放互市和海禁，战争就没了——贸易不是零和博弈，规则常常是在冲突耗尽双方之后、在交往界面上长出来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度史</span><span class=\"tag\">上海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Indigenous Entomology (BUGS &amp; TRADITIONAL ECOLOGICAL KNOWLEDGE) with Cheyenne Reuben-Thomas cultural fire Three Sisters traditional ecological knowledge (TEK)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-ologies-入侵物种也在-干自己的活-原住民生态知识不用好坏二分法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>入侵物种也在&quot;干自己的活&quot;:原住民生态知识不用好坏二分法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">欧洲蜜蜂、亚洲瓢虫这类常被叫作「入侵种」的生物，在原住民生态知识里被看作在履行各自的生态职责，而不是非黑即白的敌人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">昆虫学</span><span class=\"tag\">原住民知识</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"BI 250 Nima Dehghani: How Brains Compute computational closure functor divisive normalization winner-take-all wave walker / pilot wave\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-braininspired-ai-的-智能体-说法是误称-自主性要靠计算闭合-不是算力堆出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9d77f3058f9aa91-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brain Inspired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的「智能体」说法是误称：自主性要靠计算闭合，不是算力堆出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判断一个系统有没有自主性，不是看它能不能做图灵完备的运算，而是看它的内部回路能不能自己闭合——这正是现在所谓AI agent名不副实的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span><span class=\"tag\">计算理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"157. 复盘Personal Agent集体诞生背后：和蔡伟聊AI产品史、需求真伪、入口与未来想象 harness MCP A2A\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-zhangxiaojun-个人助理的竞争短期看模型-中长期拼的是供给和安全信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c56751483666a88-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>个人助理的竞争短期看模型，中长期拼的是供给和安全信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蔡伟判断模型能力早晚会进入稳态、各家大差不差，届时真正拉开差距的是谁手握更多线下供给、谁的安全合规做得足够深。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Personal Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">AI产品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"对话 Google Cloud FDE 负责人王书元：FDE落到企业上，第一步是造“样板间” FDE brain in a vat FDE BP nano banana self-distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-guijilichang-别急着买工具-企业ai落地的第一步是造一个能跑通的样板间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38d8d27c2f34d3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅基立场</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>别急着买工具，企业AI落地的第一步是造一个能跑通的样板间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王书元说，AI不像数据库这类旧技术升级——每个人对AI都有自己的理解，靠集思广益很难推进，企业应该先在一个部门做出能闭环的样板，再靠示范效应说服全公司跟进。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">FDE</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI落地</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Are We Addicted to Control? with Dr Anna Lembke infinite flexibility mental map / mental model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-iq2-你的焦虑不是缺乏控制-而是控制过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e254f7f220660b07-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">40:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>你的焦虑不是缺乏控制，而是控制过了头</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Lembke 认为现代人的恐惧、孤独和羞耻感根源于「无限可塑性」的幻觉——以为自己能掌控一切，结果一旦失控就只剩自责，而真正的解药是向自己之外的更高力量交出意志。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理健康</span><span class=\"tag\">自恋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"414. Lawrence of Arabia: Palestine, Iraq, &amp; The Motorcycle Crash (Part 4)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-empirehist-劳伦斯空手赴巴黎和会-犹太代表团却带着水权地图谈妥一切/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">57:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>劳伦斯空手赴巴黎和会，犹太代表团却带着水权地图谈妥一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1919年巴黎和会上，阿拉伯代表团迟到、无文件、无策略，而犹太复国主义代表团已游说六周并备好详细的水权与移民方案，这场较量从一开始就不对等。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东史</span><span class=\"tag\">巴以冲突</span>\n</div></div></a>"]